// Real controller-body reference photos (issue #66 restyle, 2026-08-05) -- user-
// supplied, background-removed/alpha-corrected product photos of each supported
// GlyphStyle's real controller, used as the Stick/Button Layout drill-down screen's
// diagram background instead of the earlier procedurally-drawn circle/rect schematic.
// Same RCDATA/bareword-name embedding convention as the button glyphs above.
controller_body_xbox360 RCDATA "..\\assets\\controller_diagrams\\xbox360_controller_base.png"
controller_body_xboxmodern RCDATA "..\\assets\\controller_diagrams\\xboxmodern_controller_base.png"
controller_body_ps4 RCDATA "..\\assets\\controller_diagrams\\ps4_controller_base.png"

// Custom mouse cursor (2026-08-01) -- replaces the native software cursor so it
// draws correctly on top of this project's own glyph overlays (this project's
// redraw happens at end-of-frame, after the native cursor's own draw call, so the
// native cursor would otherwise render UNDER our icons). User-supplied art,
// background/glow-cropped and resized to 128x128, real alpha channel. See
// overlay_hud.cpp's cursor-draw code and analog_input_hooks.cpp's
// Hook_004d48f0 for the suppress-native/redraw-ours mechanism.
cursor_arrow RCDATA "..\\assets\\cursor_arrow.png"
